<title>USA: SBC Communications Inc Q1 earnings summary.</title>
<headline>SBC Communications Inc Q1 earnings summary.</headline>
<dateline>SAN ANTONIO 1997-05-13</dateline>
<text>
<p>1997			1996</p>
<p> Shr			  $0.94		    $0.86</p>
<p> Net			857,000		  798,000</p>
<p> Revs		   6,000,000		5,700,000</p>
<p>(All data above 000s except per share numbers)</p>
<p>NOTES: Quarters ended March 31.</p>
<p>The figures are reported on a profroma basis to reflect the April 1 merger of SBC with Pacific Telesis Group.  Both companies reported separately in 1996.</p>
<p>The 1997 net income figure includes nonrecurring items of $90 million associated with lump sum pension payments and a change in accounting. Earnings in 1997 Q1 excluding these items were $767 million, or $0.84 a share.</p>
</text>
